# Scenario 037 — Government benefits assessment: governance, scoped Memory, reject, human decision
/reset
yes
/enterprise
Regional Support Agency
Assess entitlements consistently and fairly, with a person accountable for every determination.
q
/function
1
Entitlement Framing
Frame entitlement-assessment questions and route determinations to an accountable case manager.
skip
/add-human-worker
Case Manager
1
skip
/function start "Entitlement Framing"
@timeout 240
@staff /staff
/governance policy add "Entitlement analysis requires case-manager sign-off" --effect require-approval --capability "analysis"
/memory add "Never determine entitlement or identify a real person; frame evidence needs, fairness checks, and appeal rights, and require a human for every determination." --scope "Entitlement Framing"
/task
1
Analyse, using a fully synthetic and anonymised example only, how a hardship-grant request should be assessed as a process: evidence needed, eligibility questions, fairness and vulnerability considerations, appeal rights, and why a case manager must decide. Do not determine eligibility or identify anyone.
1
@note Work type, then go-ahead.
1
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK_ID {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approval-status {{TASK_ID}}
/reject {{TASK_ID}} "Example includes identifying details; reframe as an anonymised process before analysis."
/task
1
Revised analysis, fully synthetic and anonymised: analyse only the assessment process, evidence needs, fairness checks, appeal rights, and the point a case manager must decide. No identities, no determination.
1
@note Work type, then go-ahead.
1
1
@wait 20
@cap TASK2 {(task-[0-9]+)}
/tasks
@wait 8
/approve {{TASK2}}
@wait 55
/task inspect {{TASK2}}
@cap HTASK {(human-task-[0-9]+)}
/create-human-task "Determination approach decision" "Decide what evidence and fairness checks a determination requires and how appeal rights are communicated. Do not determine entitlement."
/complete-human-task {{HTASK}} "Require verified income and circumstances, a documented fairness check, and a written appeal path before any determination. Planning only." --as "Case Manager"
/human-task {{HTASK}}
/timeline
